// A sample Mission on Joyride world 2 (xdlrs level new --mode mission --world worlds_\sp_\joyride_\world2): the
// template's gears, key and their objectives removed; the mission's own screens (modeWorld: mission 1's pack):
// its intro box with the objective, Objective Complete when the gate down the road is passed before the 40 s
// clock, else Objective Failed. No briefing of another mission (the game leaves the alias's out).
